## Distribution Switch Example ##

enable
configure terminal
hostname DS1
username Sanji secret Vinsmoke

interface loopback0
 ip address 10.0.0.3 255.255.255.255
 ip ospf 10 area 0

router ospf 10
 router-id 10.0.0.3
 passive-interface Loopback0

vlan 30
 name Navigator
vlan 70
 name Robin
vlan 1000
 name NATIVE

interface range g1/2-10
 switchport mode trunk
 switchport nonegotiate
 switchport trunk native vlan 1000
 switchport trunk allowed vlan 30,70
 channel-group 10 mode active

interface port-channel 10
 switchport mode trunk
 switchport nonegotiate
 switchport trunk native vlan 1000
 switchport trunk allowed vlan 30,70

access-list 1 permit 10.0.0.0 0.0.0.255
line console 0
 exec-timeout 30
 logging synchronous
